n who never misses a single day of training. She also sometimes takes Ryouta by force to go jogging at night, a routine she does not miss even for a single day."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The only thing Ryouta can beat Kana at is video games. She takes it out on Ryouta when she loses."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After taking a bath, she always wears only panties and a neck towel."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c43749"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f1/f10461baa24750935e21778e91c86c3a89717c2db78324b142d451b6939acb55.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9c/9cb38c99d8688c3398546708e919c124e1847792e4c96e43e58e20c0d9c3e1a9.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c43750","characterName":"岡野 真奈","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c43750"},"originalCharacterName":"岡野 真奈","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The youngest sister of the Okano family."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's a late blooming girl who dislikes Ryouta for suddenly living with her family. She is somewhat ambivalent towards him. She is naturally shy and reserved."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a rather serious and firm person in the family, but she has an extremely bad sleeping habit."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her birthday is a month earlier than Ryouta's. Deep down, Mana is probably the most pleased with Ryouta's arrival because it means she can get rid of her status as the youngest child."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c43750"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts